场合最明显？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"上大学以后开始有这种感觉，像是换了个环境，被看见的分量也变了。那种“别人在看我”的感觉，通常是在什么场合最明显？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1596,"promptTokens":1885,"completionTokens":68,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:18"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":9,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012427774683888334,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af677a2f4429d1fd72f79bc","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537378838,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677a2f4429d1fd72f79bc","chatId":"90e893ef53e64b078494ca0357c9ee7d","sessionId":null,"userId":99859,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……说不上具体哪一天吧，好像慢慢地就这样了。可能是……上大学以后？我也不确定，反正就是老觉得别人在看我、在评价我。<第4轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":8,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012427774683888334,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":6,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af677a2f4429d1fd72f79bd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537378835,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6779ef4429d1fd72f79b2","chatId":"90e893ef53e64b078494ca0357c9ee7d","sessionId":null,"userId":99859,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"心里堵着、做什么都不自在，这种感受本身就值得说一说，不用先判断它算不算“大问题”。很多人都是先觉得不对劲，才慢慢理清楚的。这种感觉大概是从什么时候开始的？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"心里堵着、做什么都不自在，这种感受本身就值得说一说，不用先判断它算不算“大问题”。很多人都是先觉得不对劲，才慢慢理清楚的。这种感觉大概是从什么时候开始的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1864,"promptTokens":1764,"completionTokens":84,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:14"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":7,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574281824192494,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6779ef4429d1fd72f79b1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537374066,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6779ef4429d1fd72f79b1","chatId":"90e893ef53e64b078494ca0357c9ee7d","sessionId":null,"userId":99859,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"哦……这样啊。其实我也说不太清楚，就是最近总觉得心里堵得慌，做什么都不太自在。嗯……我也不知道这算不算什么大问题。<第3轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":nu